# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on a GPU
# (D198), scenario npt-double of Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py.
# NPT runs with drawn velocities and restraints against `mdir run` of the
# same control file in double precision, and the effect of the restraints
# and of their reference.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir mdir-model-test %t npt-double | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NPT: the restraints change the potential
# CHECK: velocities and restraints npt-double passed
